{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7508090dff6e2c983ef2daa2e971ce70795debb06869beb1cb13593a27714146", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、可奈と\n学校に来た。今回は設定が決まっていて……）", "zh": "（为了写真照杂志《I‧G‧R‧A！！》的拍摄，\n我和可奈一起来到学校。这次的设定已经定案了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "afc9874a43e7cc918a79aa66932ca12565fd79f23545a3b3791cbfdcb6d2d5a7", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n今日は私、給食当番の役なんですよね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n我今天要扮演负责打菜的同学对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "41389a11c920dbe5903c06d97c114e7b4b5fab092d40d56441be38196ab6a7f4", "ja": "可奈が配る給食は何かな～♪\nカレーかな～、焼きそばかな～♪", "zh": "可奈要打的菜是什么呢～♪\n是咖哩吗～还是炒面～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1003_p", "source_sha256": "274a8772e2afd77323b19e59383196b832c3dcba7f216f8db8bc9c50f904bdbf", "ja": "可奈、ずいぶん楽しそうだな。\n給食当番なんて面倒じゃないのか？", "zh": "可奈，你看起来好像很开心。\n难道你不会觉得打菜很麻烦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "1e4a21e5994b522fe868a54f12a3567e45614da5594535a6486b49584d7051ee", "ja": "そんなことないですよ！　今日の献立は何かな～って\n考えてると、ワクワクしちゃいますし……。", "zh": "才不会呢！想着今天的菜单不知道是什么～\n我的心情就会雀跃起来，而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "4fae76cfe39cc75efb4dabebd20a13ca31b738908d214ef8fe77bf1618985706", "ja": "好きなメニューが出ると、すっごくうれしいんです！\nおかわりしちゃおうかな～、でもでも食べすぎかな～？", "zh": "如果有自己爱吃的菜，就会高兴得不得了！\n要不要再来一碗呢～可是会不会吃太多呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1006_p", "source_sha256": "38d827f20d19a56158fa649cc5bff903ad093a2ff4cd16fb2d403fc3afa7706b", "ja": "はは、そうか。\n可奈の学校は、給食がおいしいのか？", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。\n可奈学校的营养午餐很好吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "fa10fe612c3bbcea452cc7bf83bd31b0ba668f1c66155fb825c80c29405554b6", "ja": "そうなんです！\nうちの学校の給食、すっごくおいしいんですよー！", "zh": "没错！\n我们学校的营养午餐超级好吃的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "47837b2502461f80344cb2f4d89fa5959f8a446b85c6ef627892874391f36d5e", "ja": "給食室の前を通るといい匂いがするから、\n毎日とっても楽しみで。えへ♪", "zh": "经过学校厨房前面就能闻到香味，\n让我每天都好期待，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "0446f6515200b2dd8b24e595e4c5a600bc14483f3167875ff1d90e963f514901", "ja": "だから、今日もいっぱい食べちゃいま……\nあああ～っ！？", "zh": "所以，我今天也要大吃特……\n啊啊啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4cfb56990dbfb2e712c63fa2c9485d82c15e9255888aa030689d2a12af854c1e", "ja": "ど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "你、你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "635eb21755e50d9c233e3ecb86c5d50e935b5f8426bbf7b732acdd6ac2a524b8", "ja": "ううっ……{$P$}さぁん！　私、\nすっかり給食を食べるつもりで来たんですけど……。", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}先生～！\n我整个抱着要吃营养午餐的心情过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "06698340b28573c7821cb1c2b9b07c75c6b326870bb2d54825401ad555f50697", "ja": "もしかして今日って、撮影だけで食べられないですか？\nご飯をよそったり、配ったりするだけとか……？", "zh": "但今天是不是只有拍摄而已，吃不到东西？\n只会盛一盛饭，夹一夹菜之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1013_p", "source_sha256": "38844cb6058960a072166d332a944bf52b1d44b00fd1c5f1e7f0fa150b65b166", "ja": "ああ、それなら大丈夫。給食を食べている\nシーンも撮るみたいだから、ちゃんと食べられるよ。", "zh": "啊，这点你不用担心。\n好像也要拍摄吃营养午餐的画面，所以吃得到东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "a87637008a0efb2e0cca810d9b6a0f888022c3a4b15bbd287a9a82c8f6a2108f", "ja": "本当ですか！？　やったー！", "zh": "真的吗！？太棒了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "6a9784372ee743b1659d8d31243a7f7047aa3ff4b7468a3eaea4b5d45e8fbe70", "ja": "お腹ペコペコ矢吹可奈～♪\nどんな給食出てくるかな～♪", "zh": "肚子饿扁扁的矢吹可奈～♪\n会出现什么样的营养午餐呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "4b452e0eecb0454d7e4f8a6e7039809d97d63c5ab09db1af4e20e3b7d631ccce", "ja": "はれっ！？　{$P$}さん、\nなんだかいい匂いがしてきましたよ！？", "zh": "咦！？{$P$}先生，\n好像闻到一股香味了耶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7e54d249477766bbe2ac75b8867513126f9328c3d0942a48c78e489d0ff100a8", "ja": "ああ、撮影の準備ができたみたいだな。\n可奈、いけそうか？", "zh": "嗯，拍摄的准备工作好像完成了。\n可奈，你可以上了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "81a159c491c2d1725767759e4fa44d4c72e28c519461991b2b11a6481b215a81", "ja": "はいっ！　いっぱい食べ……じゃなくて、\nいっぱいがんばりますっ！", "zh": "可以！我会好好吃……不对，\n我会好好加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "4047fa3c427589fad1e1ebf37bd61c224635203346b6945ab48f51b72ccb4ca0", "ja": "あつあつ焼きそば～♪　ソースたっぷり～♪\n青のりもたっぷり～♪　おいしそう～♪", "zh": "热腾腾的炒面～♪淋满酱汁～♪\n海苔粉也洒满满～♪看起来好好吃～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0153_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6b861032c721460d034ca824a4a15613261dad6a29f57227023385c153e65218", "ja": "（撮影では、可奈のいい笑顔がたくさん撮れた。\n食べている写真が多い気がするが……それもいいかな）", "zh": "（拍摄过程中，捕捉到许多可奈的灿烂笑容。\n虽然吃东西的照片好像比较多……不过也不错啦。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
